@startuml
!include ../../../images/common-sequence.iuml

title HW-Reg — Cloud Registration

actor "Operator" as Op

box "HW-Reg Device (ESP8266)" $OnPrem
    participant "HW-Reg\nFirmware" as HWReg
end box

box "Internet" $Vendor
    participant "NTP\npool.ntp.org" as NTP
end box

box "AWS" $AWS
    participant "FireFly-Cloud" as Cloud
end box

== Connect to WiFi ==

Op -> HWReg : **POST /api/network/wifi**\n""{ ssid, password }""
note right of HWReg : SoftAP remains alive (WIFI_AP_STA)\nso the browser session is not dropped.\nCredentials are never persisted.
HWReg -> HWReg : **Switch to WIFI_AP_STA**\n**Connect to WiFi STA**
HWReg -> NTP : **configTime(0, 0, "pool.ntp.org")**
NTP --> HWReg : **Time synced**
HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 200**\n""{ "ip": "<ip>" }""

== Cloud Registration ==

Op -> HWReg : **POST /api/registration**\n""X-Registration-Key: ABC123""
HWReg -> HWReg : **HKDF-SHA-256(master_key,**\n**info="firefly-auth-v1") → key_auth**
HWReg -> HWReg : **Compute P-256 public key**\n**from key_auth scalar**
HWReg -> HWReg : **Zero key_auth from RAM**
HWReg -> Cloud : **POST /devices/register**\n""X-Registration-Key: ABC123""\n""{ uuid, product_id, product_hex,""\n""  device_class, public_key, mcu{...} }""

alt HTTP 204 No Content
    Cloud --> HWReg : **HTTP 204 No Content**
    HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 204 No Content**
else HTTP 401 or 403 — invalid or expired key
    Cloud --> HWReg : **HTTP 401 / 403**
    HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 403**\n""{ "error": "invalid or expired registration key" }""
else Other error
    Cloud --> HWReg : **HTTP <status>**
    HWReg --> Op : **HTTP 502**\n""{ "error": "cloud registration failed" }""
end

@enduml
